# Ingris Stingerquill's trigger is "that creature deals 1 damage to each opponent". Bot1's Healer's Hawk (1/1 flying lifelink)
# and Ingris attack on turn 3 and Bot2 answers the Hawk's trigger by killing the Hawk with Lightning Bolt: the ability still
# resolves with the Hawk as it last existed the source of the damage (CR 113.7a, 608.2h), so Bot2 still takes 1 and, the
# lifelink being the Hawk's, Bot1 gains 1 (21). Bot2: 1 per trigger (2) plus Ingris's 1 combat damage: 17.

